    -- Degree-4 coefficient: -2 for each of C(5,4)=5 monomials
    -- Degree-5 coefficient: +3 for the single monomial x1*x2*x3*x4*x5
    -- Verification at all-ones input: 10*1 - 2*5*1 + 3*1 = 10 - 10 + 3 = 3 ≠ 1
    -- Correction: the multilinear polynomial for THR_{3,5} has coefficients from
    -- inclusion-exclusion applied to the Boolean function directly.
    -- f(x) = sum_{S: |S|>=3} coeff(S) * x_S where coefficients satisfy
